MSG_CD_451 (451//)
Add the CD-ROM drive for ISO and CUE/BIN images, at uaescsi.device or as ATAPI drive at the IDE interface. If there is one already, it is edited.
;
MSG_CD_452 (452//)
CD-ROM drives
